function MasterPage({t,run,refresh}:Any){const[rows,R]=useState<Any[]>([]),[kind,K]=useState('costCenters'),[form,F]=useState<Any>({code:'',nameRo:'',nameEn:'',from:today(),to:'',active:true,reason:''}),[values,V]=useState<Any>({}),[retireDate,RD]=useState(today());const load=()=>api('/configuration/masters').then(R);useEffect(()=>{run(load);},[]);const set=(k:string,v:any)=>F({...form,[k]:v});return <><div className="page-heading"><div><span className="eyebrow">{t('CONFIGURARE','CONFIGURATION')}</span><h1>{t('Nomenclatoare și reguli','Master data & rules')}</h1><p>{t('Versiuni cu perioade de valabilitate. Închide versiunea anterioară înainte de a crea una nouă.','Effective-dated versions. Close the preceding version before creating a new one.')}</p></div></div><section className="panel"><Field name={t('Nomenclator','Master type')}><select value={kind} onChange={e=>{K(e.target.value);V({});}}>{Object.entries(masterKinds).map(([k,n])=><option key={k} value={k}>{t(...n)}</option>)}</select></Field><form onSubmit={e=>{e.preventDefault();run(async()=>{const data={...values};if(kind==='fieldRules'){data.conditions=Object.fromEntries(['country','documentType','category','payment','currency'].filter(k=>data[k]).map(k=>[k,data[k]]));for(const key of ['country','documentType','category','payment','currency'])delete data[key];}await api('/configuration/masters','POST',{...form,kind,to:form.to||null,json:JSON.stringify(data)});await load();await refresh();});}}><div className="form-grid">{[['code',t('Cod','Code')],['nameRo','Denumire în română'],['nameEn','English name'],['from',t('Valabil din','Effective from')],['to',t('Valabil până la (opțional)','Effective to (optional)')]].map(([key,name])=><Field key={key} name={name}><input type={['from','to'].includes(key)?'date':'text'} value={form[key]} required={key!=='to'} onChange={e=>set(key,e.target.value)}/></Field>)}{masterFields[kind].map(key=><Field key={key} name={t(...fieldNames[key])}>{['vehicle','repair'].includes(key)?<select value={String(values[key]||false)} onChange={e=>V({...values,[key]:e.target.value==='true'})}><option value="false">{t('Nu','No')}</option><option value="true">{t('Da','Yes')}</option></select>:key==='state'?<select value={values[key]||''} required onChange={e=>V({...values,[key]:e.target.value})}><option value="">{t('Selectează','Select')}</option>{['REQUIRED','OPTIONAL','NOT_APPLICABLE'].map(s=><option key={s}>{s}</option>)}</select>:<input value={values[key]??''} type={['rate','ronRate','priority'].includes(key)?'number':'text'} step="any" onChange={e=>V({...values,[key]:['rate','ronRate','priority'].includes(key)?Number(e.target.value):e.target.value})}/>}</Field>)}</div><Field name={t('Motivul modificării','Reason for change')}><input required minLength={3} value={form.reason} onChange={e=>set('reason',e.target.value)}/></Field><button className="primary"><Plus size={16}/>{t('Creează versiune','Create version')}</button></form><div className="queue"><Field name={t('Închidere perioadă la','Close period on')}><input type="date" value={retireDate} onChange={e=>RD(e.target.value)}/></Field>{rows.filter(m=>m.kind===kind).map(m=><div className="simple-row" key={m.id}><span><strong>{m.code} · {m.nameRo}</strong><small>{m.from} → {m.to||'∞'}</small></span><button className="secondary" disabled={form.reason.length<3} onClick={()=>run(async()=>{await api('/configuration/masters/'+m.id+'/retire','POST',{to:retireDate,reason:form.reason});await load();await refresh();})}>{t('Închide perioada','Close period')}</button></div>)}</div></section></>;}
function UsersPage({t,run}:Any){const[users,U]=useState<Any[]>([]),[form,F]=useState<Any>({username:'',name:'',email:'',worker:'',managerId:'',active:true,roles:['Employee'],password:'',reason:''}),[id,I]=useState('');const load=()=>api('/admin/users').then(U);useEffect(()=>{run(load);},[]);const set=(k:string,v:any)=>F({...form,[k]:v});return <><div className="page-heading"><div><span className="eyebrow">{t('ADMINISTRARE','ADMINISTRATION')}</span><h1>{t('Utilizatori și acces','Users & access')}</h1><p>{t('Conturi administrate intern, roluri și rutare către manager.','Internally managed accounts, roles and manager routing.')}</p></div></div><section className="panel"><h2>{id?t('Editează contul','Edit account'):t('Creează un cont','Create an account')}</h2><form onSubmit={e=>{e.preventDefault();run(async()=>{await api('/admin/users'+(id?'/'+id:''),id?'PUT':'POST',{...form,managerId:form.managerId||null});await load();});}}><div className="form-grid">{[['username',t('Utilizator','Username')],['name',t('Nume complet','Full name')],['email','Email'],['worker',t('Cod Worker','Worker code')]].map(([k,n])=><Field name={n} key={k}><input required value={form[k]||''} type={k==='email'?'email':'text'} disabled={k==='username'&&!!id} onChange={e=>set(k,e.target.value)}/></Field>)}<Field name={t('Manager','Manager')}><select value={form.managerId||''} onChange={e=>set('managerId',e.target.value)}><option value="">{t('Fără manager','No manager')}</option>{users.filter(u=>u.active&&u.roles.includes('Manager')&&u.id!==id).map(u=><option key={u.id} value={u.id}>{u.name}</option>)}</select></Field><Field name={t('Parolă temporară','Temporary password')}><input type="password" minLength={12} autoComplete="new-password" required={!id} value={form.password} onChange={e=>set('password',e.target.value)}/></Field><Field name={t('Motiv','Reason')}><input value={form.reason||''} required={!!id} onChange={e=>set('reason',e.target.value)}/></Field><Field name={t('Acces','Access')}><select value={String(form.active)} onChange={e=>set('active',e.target.value==='true')}><option value="true">{t('Activ','Active')}</option><option value="false">{t('Dezactivat','Disabled')}</option></select></Field></div><div className="role-picker">{['Employee','Manager','Finance','Admin','Auditor','FinanceReopen'].map(role=><label key={role}><input type="checkbox" checked={form.roles.includes(role)} onChange={e=>set('roles',e.target.checked?[...form.roles,role]:form.roles.filter((r:string)=>r!==role))}/>{role}</label>)}</div><div className="actions"><button className="primary">{t('Salvează contul','Save account')}</button>{id&&<><button type="button" className="secondary" disabled={!form.password||form.reason.length<3} onClick={()=>run(async()=>{await api('/admin/users/'+id+'/reset','POST',{password:form.password,reason:form.reason});await load();set('password','');})}>{t('Resetează parola','Reset password')}</button><button type="button" className="secondary" disabled={form.reason.length<3} onClick={()=>run(async()=>{await api('/admin/users/'+id+'/unlock','POST',{reason:form.reason});await load();})}>{t('Deblochează contul','Unlock account')}</button><button type="button" className="text-button" onClick={()=>{I('');F({username:'',name:'',email:'',worker:'',managerId:'',active:true,roles:['Employee'],password:'',reason:''});}}>{t('Cont nou','New account')}</button></>}</div></form><div className="queue">{users.map(u=><button className="simple-row row-button" key={u.id} onClick={()=>{I(u.id);F({...u,username:u.userName,password:'',reason:''});}}><span><strong>{u.name} {u.active?'':'· '+t('Dezactivat','Disabled')}</strong><small>{u.userName} · {u.email}</small></span><span>{u.roles.join(' · ')}</span><ArrowUpRight size={16}/></button>)}</div></section></>;}
function CardsPage({t,masters,label,run,open}:Any){const[data,D]=useState<Any>({transactions:[],matches:[]}),[suggestions,S]=useState<Any[]>([]),[card,C]=useState(''),[csv,Csv]=useState(''),[preview,P]=useState<Any|null>(null),[tx,Tx]=useState(''),[line,L]=useState(''),[amount,A]=useState('');const load=async()=>{D(await api('/finance/transactions'));S(await api('/finance/suggestions'));};useEffect(()=>{run(load);},[]);const bank={cardId:card,csv,columns:{}};return <><div className="page-heading"><div><span className="eyebrow">{t('RECONCILIERE','RECONCILIATION')}</span><h1>{t('Carduri și tranzacții','Cards & transactions')}</h1><p>{t('Importă extrasul, verifică sugestiile și confirmă alocările.','Import a statement, review suggestions and confirm allocations.')}</p></div></div><section className="panel"><h2>{t('Import extras CSV','Import CSV statement')}</h2><Field name={t('Card','Card')}><select value={card} onChange={e=>C(e.target.value)}><option value="">{t('Selectează','Select')}</option>{masters.filter((m:Any)=>m.kind==='cards'&&m.active).map((m:Any)=><option key={m.id} value={m.id}>{label(m)}</option>)}</select></Field><label className="upload-button"><Upload size={16}/>{t('Selectează extrasul CSV','Select CSV statement')}<input type="file" accept=".csv" onChange={async e=>{const file=e.target.files?.[0];if(file)Csv(await file.text());}}/></label><p className="muted small">{t('Coloane: reference, date, merchant, amount, currency, settledRon. Dată YYYY-MM-DD; separator virgulă; punct zecimal.','Columns: reference, date, merchant, amount, currency, settledRon. Date YYYY-MM-DD; comma separator; decimal point.')}</p><textarea className="csv-preview" value={csv} onChange={e=>Csv(e.target.value)} placeholder="reference,date,merchant,amount,currency,settledRon"/><div className="actions"><button className="secondary" disabled={!card||!csv} onClick={()=>run(async()=>P(await api('/finance/transactions/preview','POST',bank)))}>{t('Verifică importul','Preview import')}</button><button className="primary" disabled={!preview||preview.duplicates.length>0} onClick={()=>run(async()=>{await api('/finance/transactions/import','POST',bank);await load();P(null);Csv('');})}>{t('Confirmă importul','Confirm import')}</button></div>{preview&&<p>{preview.count} {t('tranzacții','transactions')} · {preview.duplicates.length} {t('duplicate','duplicates')}</p>}</section><section className="panel queue"><h2>{t('Sugestii de asociere','Match suggestions')}</h2>{suggestions.filter(s=>s.remaining>0).map(s=><div className="transaction" key={s.transaction.id}><div className="simple-row"><span><strong>{s.transaction.merchant}</strong><small>{s.transaction.reference} · {s.transaction.date}</small></span><strong>{money(s.remaining)} {s.transaction.currency}</strong></div>{s.candidates.map((candidate:Any)=><div className="suggestion" key={candidate.id}><span>{t('Potrivire','Match')} {candidate.score}/100 · {money(candidate.amount)}</span><button className="text-button" onClick={()=>{Tx(s.transaction.id);L(candidate.id);A(String(Math.min(s.remaining,candidate.amount)));}}>{t('Selectează','Select')}</button><button className="text-button" onClick={()=>open(candidate.reportId)}>{t('Deschide decontul','Open report')}</button></div>)}</div>)}<div className="form-grid"><Field name={t('Tranzacție','Transaction')}><select value={tx} onChange={e=>Tx(e.target.value)}><option value="">{t('Selectează','Select')}</option>{data.transactions.map((x:Any)=><option key={x.id} value={x.id}>{x.reference} · {x.merchant}</option>)}</select></Field><Field name={t('ID cheltuială','Expense ID')}><input value={line} onChange={e=>L(e.target.value)}/></Field><Field name={t('Sumă alocată în moneda tranzacției','Allocated transaction currency amount')}><input type="number" min="0.01" step="0.01" value={amount} onChange={e=>A(e.target.value)}/></Field></div><button className="primary" disabled={!tx||!line||!amount} onClick={()=>run(async()=>{const s=suggestions.find(s=>s.transaction.id===tx);const candidate=s?.candidates.find((l:Any)=>l.id===line);if(!candidate)throw new Error(t('Selectează o cheltuială sugerată.','Select a suggested expense.'));const detail=await api('/reports/'+candidate.reportId);await api('/finance/matches','POST',{reportId:candidate.reportId,version:detail.report.version,lineId:line,transactionId:tx,amount:Number(amount)});await load();})}>{t('Confirmă alocarea','Confirm allocation')}</button></section></>;}
function DelegationPage({t,run}:Any){const[rows,R]=useState<Any[]>([]),[users,U]=useState<Any[]>([]),[form,F]=useState({managerId:'',delegateId:'',from:today(),to:today()});const load=()=>api('/admin/delegations').then(R);useEffect(()=>{run(async()=>{await load();U(await api('/admin/users'));});},[]);return <section className="panel"><h1>{t('Delegări de aprobare','Approval delegations')}</h1><form onSubmit={e=>{e.preventDefault();run(async()=>{await api('/admin/delegations','POST',form);await load();});}}><div className="form-grid">{(['managerId','delegateId'] as const).map(k=><Field key={k} name={k==='managerId'?'Manager':t('Delegat','Delegate')}><select required value={form[k]} onChange={e=>F({...form,[k]:e.target.value})}><option value="">{t('Selectează','Select')}</option>{users.filter(u=>u.active&&u.roles.includes('Manager')).map(u=><option key={u.id} value={u.id}>{u.name}</option>)}</select></Field>)}{(['from','to'] as const).map(k=><Field key={k} name={k==='from'?t('Din','From'):t('Până la','To')}><input type="date" required value={form[k]} onChange={e=>F({...form,[k]:e.target.value})}/></Field>)}</div><button className="primary">{t('Creează delegare','Create delegation')}</button></form>{rows.map(d=><div className="simple-row" key={d.id}><span>{users.find(u=>u.id===d.managerId)?.name} → {users.find(u=>u.id===d.delegateId)?.name}<small>{d.from} — {d.to}</small></span><button className="secondary danger" onClick={()=>run(async()=>{await api('/admin/delegations/'+d.id,'DELETE');await load();})}>{t('Revocă','Revoke')}</button></div>)}</section>;}
function DataPage({path,title,t,run}:Any){const[rows,R]=useState<Any[]>([]);useEffect(()=>{run(async()=>R(await api(path)));},[path]);return <section className="panel"><div className="section-heading"><h1>{title}</h1><a href="/api/analytics/csv" className="secondary"><Download size={16}/>{t('Raport CSV','CSV report')}</a></div><div className="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>{t('Moment','Time')}</th><th>{t('Utilizator','Actor')}</th><th>{t('Acțiune','Action')}</th><th>{t('Entitate','Entity')}</th><th>{t('Motiv','Reason')}</th></tr></thead><tbody>{rows.map(r=><tr key={r.id}><td>{new Date(r.at).toLocaleString()}</td><td>{r.actor}</td><td>{r.action}</td><td>{r.entity}</td><td>{r.reason}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></section>;}
function JobsPage({t,run}:Any){const[rows,R]=useState<Any[]>([]),[reason,Reason]=useState('');const load=()=>api('/admin/jobs').then(R);useEffect(()=>{run(load);},[]);return <section className="panel"><h1>{t('Operațiuni de fundal','Background jobs')}</h1><Field name={t('Motiv pentru reîncercare','Retry reason')}><input value={reason} onChange={e=>Reason(e.target.value)}/></Field>{rows.map(j=><div className="simple-row" key={j.id}><span><strong>{j.kind} · {j.state}</strong><small>{j.attempts} {t('încercări','attempts')} · {new Date(j.due).toLocaleString()}</small><small>{j.error}</small></span>{j.state==='Failed'&&<button className="secondary" disabled={reason.length<3} onClick={()=>run(async()=>{await api('/admin/jobs/'+j.id+'/retry','POST',{reason});await load();})}>{t('Reîncearcă','Retry')}</button>}</div>)}</section>;}
